    "summary": "Adopt a checkpoint",
    "description": "Adopt a checkpoint slot directory made by the existing desktop setup (`candidate snapshot` or `capture`) and start (or adopt) its template server. Without `expected_state_hash` the origin slot's running desktop is hashed, else the first child defines it (recorded in `hash_reference`).",
