    "summary": "Reset",
    "description": "Start a new episode: kill the tree (cgroup.kill), swap in a fresh upper layer (warm spare), restore from the slot's checkpoint, run every gate. Allowed from `ready` and `down`. A failure before any task ran is retried per the recovery policy; every attempt and its cost is in `cost.attempts`.",
